WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.833
 

00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:04.375
 

00:00:04.375 --> 00:00:06.208
 

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.583
Listen kid, I’m a cool boss.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:11.875
We’re not a “traditional work place.”

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:13.000
What skills do you have?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:13.583
 

00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:14.125
 

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:16.833
 

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:17.666
Maybe we’ll be in touch.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:18.291
Maybe we won’t!

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:19.166
It’s all a big secret!

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:19.625
Baker.

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:20.291
Sam.

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:20.958
Josh Allen.

00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:21.666
The Cardinals.

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.000
The Raiders are a great organization,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.500
and we’re going to burn it to the ground, man.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.200
 

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:30.400
So just by looking at you,

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:33.000
I think you’re definitely Broncos QB material.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.958
Sir, that’s a mop.

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:34.750
Still.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.700
I like that it’s tall.

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.160
HELLO!

00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:40.041
IT’S TIME FOR THE CAREER DAY SELECTIONS.

00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:41.500
-BOOOO!
-YOU SUCK!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.791
Hahaha, every year this hurts my feelings.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.125
Hello, I am Mel Kiper,

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:46.458
and I have ranked the children.

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:47.750
HIRE THE EXCITING ONES!

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:48.666
I WANT BIG NAMES

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:50.125
AND KIDS FROM ALABAMA!

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:51.375
Hey, this is pretty stressful.

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:51.666
Psst,

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.833
would you guys like to play for the GIANTS?

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:56.208
WELL YOU CAN’T!

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:57.125
GET THEM!

00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:58.041
AHHH!!

00:00:58.041 --> 00:01:00.000
NEVER MESS WITH THE MANNINGS ON CAREER DAY.

